{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-37730","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41639","text":"stackdocs — the whole [&] stack, as a filesystem you can walk"}]},{"id":"blk-37731","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41640","text":"A single, navigable documentation site that "},{"id":"spn-41641","marks":["bold"],"text":"mirrors the live repository's filesystem"},{"id":"spn-41642","text":": every real "},{"id":"spn-41643","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-41644","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-41645","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-41646","text":" markdown file across all 20 projects becomes a page whose route *is* its source path. No files are moved. Open "},{"id":"spn-41647","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/index.html"},{"id":"spn-41648","text":" — single file, no server."}]},{"id":"blk-37732","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41649","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-37733","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41650","text":"The home page is a "},{"id":"spn-41651","marks":["bold"],"text":"Runefort campus"},{"id":"spn-41652","text":": the stack rendered as a place you can walk. Directories are floors (campus → building → floor), documents are rooms. The left rail is the real filesystem tree; the top bar is a live breadcrumb of the current path. Each document page shows its "},{"id":"spn-41653","marks":["bold"],"text":"source path"},{"id":"spn-41654","text":" (with a copy button), the rendered markdown, and a right rail of typed neighbors: outgoing links, "},{"id":"spn-41655","marks":["bold"],"text":"backlinks"},{"id":"spn-41656","text":" (\"referenced by\"), and siblings in the same folder."}]},{"id":"blk-37734","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41657","text":"Because "},{"id":"spn-41658","marks":["code"],"text":"route === source path"},{"id":"spn-41659","text":", an AI agent reading the rendered docs can round- trip back to the exact file on disk, and vice-versa. "},{"id":"spn-41660","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-41661","text":" is the machine-readable route⇄source map for exactly this."}]},{"id":"blk-37735","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41662","text":"How it dogfoods the stack (in the build, not as metaphor)"}]},{"id":"blk-37736","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41663","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41664","text":" uses the real "},{"id":"spn-41665","marks":["code"],"text":"@bendscript/core"},{"id":"spn-41666","text":" npm package to:"}]},{"id":"blk-37737","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41667","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-41668","marks":["bold"],"text":"Mirror the filesystem"},{"id":"spn-41669","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-41670","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41671","text":" scans the repo (excluding "},{"id":"spn-41672","marks":["code"],"text":"node_modules"},{"id":"spn-41673","text":", "},{"id":"spn-41674","marks":["code"],"text":"_build"},{"id":"spn-41675","text":", "},{"id":"spn-41676","marks":["code"],"text":"deps"},{"id":"spn-41677","text":", "},{"id":"spn-41678","marks":["code"],"text":"old_scrap"},{"id":"spn-41679","text":", etc.), collecting every "},{"id":"spn-41680","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-41681","text":"+"},{"id":"spn-41682","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-41683","text":" "},{"id":"spn-41684","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-41685","text":" file plus top-level READMEs. 223 docs / 20 projects. 2. "},{"id":"spn-41686","marks":["bold"],"text":"Turn each file into a validated BendScript document"},{"id":"spn-41687","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-41688","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41689","text":" parses the markdown to blocks; "},{"id":"spn-41690","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41691","text":" emits BendScript; each doc is validated against the protocol schema, normalized, and "},{"id":"spn-41692","marks":["bold"],"text":"content-addressed"},{"id":"spn-41693","text":" (CIDv1). The CID is shown in the reader rail — change a file, its id changes. 3. "},{"id":"spn-41694","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type every cross-doc link as an edge"},{"id":"spn-41695","text":" — relative "},{"id":"spn-41696","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-41697","text":" links that resolve to a known route become internal navigation; the graph is inverted to produce backlinks. Unresolvable links degrade gracefully (never fail the build). 4. "},{"id":"spn-41698","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify the round-trip invariant"},{"id":"spn-41699","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-41700","marks":["code"],"text":"parse(serialize(parse(d)))"},{"id":"spn-41701","text":" is checked to be a CID fixpoint across the whole corpus — the protocol's load-bearing claim, now proven over 223 real documents."}]},{"id":"blk-37738","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41702","text":"The campus *is* Runefort's "},{"id":"spn-41703","marks":["code"],"text":"codebase-atlas"},{"id":"spn-41704","text":" idea; the pages *are* BendScript's \"prose is one projection of the graph.\" The medium is the message."}]},{"id":"blk-37739","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41705","text":"Robustness: the build never breaks on real content"}]},{"id":"blk-37740","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41706","text":"Real markdown is messy. The ingest pipeline falls back to a raw code-block view for any document it can't cleanly parse, counting fallbacks in the build report (currently "},{"id":"spn-41707","marks":["bold"],"text":"0"},{"id":"spn-41708","text":"). So new or unusual docs join the atlas automatically without ever failing the build."}]},{"id":"blk-37741","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41709","text":"Build it"}]},{"id":"blk-37742","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"npm i                 # box-and-box + @bendscript/core\nnpm run build         # node build-atlas.mjs → dist/index.html + dist/atlas.json + dist/bend/*\nnpm run build:curated # the earlier 21-page curated proof (node build.mjs)"},{"id":"blk-37743","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41710","text":"Build report (actual output):"}]},{"id":"blk-37744","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  ✓ 223 real docs mirrored from 20 projects (no files moved)\n  ✓ route === source path for every page (lossless agent round-trip)\n  ✓ 9 cross-doc links resolved to internal navigation\n  ✓ every page is a validated, content-addressed BendScript document\n  ✓ round-trip CID fixpoint holds across the corpus: true\n  ✓ 0 doc(s) fell back to raw view (unparseable markdown)"},{"id":"blk-37745","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41711","text":"Extending it"}]},{"id":"blk-37746","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37748","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41712","marks":["bold"],"text":"Add docs:"},{"id":"spn-41713","text":" just add markdown under any project's "},{"id":"spn-41714","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-41715","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-41716","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-41717","text":". The"}]}],"id":"blk-37747","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-37749","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41718","text":"next build picks it up — it joins the tree, the floors, search, and the graph."}]},{"id":"blk-37750","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37752","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41719","marks":["bold"],"text":"Point an agent at it:"},{"id":"spn-41720","text":" read "},{"id":"spn-41721","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-41722","text":" for the "},{"id":"spn-41723","marks":["code"],"text":"route ⇄ source"}]}],"id":"blk-37751","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-37753","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41724","text":"mapping, or read any "},{"id":"spn-41725","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/bend/<slug>.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-41726","text":" for the content-addressed BendScript form of a single file."}]},{"id":"blk-37754","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41727","text":"Files"}]},{"id":"blk-37755","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37757","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41728","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41729","text":" — the filesystem-mirror build (primary)"}]}],"id":"blk-37756","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37759","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41730","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41731","text":" — repo scan → filesystem tree + route↔source map"}]}],"id":"blk-37758","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37761","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41732","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41733","text":" — markdown → BendScript blocks (with raw-view fallback)"}]}],"id":"blk-37760","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37763","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41734","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41735","text":" — BendScript → HTML, link resolution"}]}],"id":"blk-37762","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37765","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41736","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.css"},{"id":"spn-41737","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-41738","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.js"},{"id":"spn-41739","text":" — the Runefort campus client"}]}],"id":"blk-37764","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37767","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41740","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/"},{"id":"spn-41741","text":" — built site ("},{"id":"spn-41742","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-41743","text":", "},{"id":"spn-41744","marks":["code"],"text":"atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-41745","text":", "},{"id":"spn-41746","marks":["code"],"text":"bend/*.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-41747","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-37766","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37769","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41748","marks":["code"],"text":"build.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41749","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-41750","marks":["code"],"text":"content.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41751","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-41752","marks":["code"],"text":"sources.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41753","text":" — the earlier curated 21-page proof"}]}],"id":"blk-37768","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieras655y4ghztfpoktbgyye4luytcxctcanjyrfa5h725yvj6e26vlq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}